```mermaid
graph TB
    Start([Train your model<br/>Measure errors]) --> CheckBias{Training error<br/>close to human<br/>level error?}
    
    CheckBias -->|NO<br/>training error high| HighBias[HIGH BIAS<br/>Underfitting]
    CheckBias -->|YES<br/>training error low| CheckVar{Dev error<br/>close to<br/>training error?}
    
    CheckVar -->|NO<br/>big gap| HighVar[HIGH VARIANCE<br/>Overfitting]
    CheckVar -->|YES<br/>small gap| Perfect[Both Low ✅<br/>Ship it!]
    
    HighBias --> FixBias[Fix bias:<br/>• Bigger network<br/>• More layers<br/>• Train longer<br/>• Better architecture]
    HighVar --> FixVar[Fix variance:<br/>• More training data<br/>• L2 regularization<br/>• Dropout<br/>• Smaller network<br/>• Early stopping]
    
    FixBias --> Start
    FixVar --> Start
    
    style Start fill:#e3f2fd
    style HighBias fill:#ffcdd2
    style HighVar fill:#fff9c4
    style Perfect fill:#c8e6c9
    style FixBias fill:#f8bbd0
    style FixVar fill:#fff59d
```
